.TH "TUSK" "1" "Jul 2026" "Tusk" "Tusk Manual"

.SH NAME
tusk-claude-status - Report the Claude Code plugin installed in this workspace


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtusk claude status [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Report whether the plugin is installed, the tusk version it was installed
by against this binary's, the binary it runs and whether that resolves,
whether its MCP server is approved, and whether .mcp.json still runs a
duplicate tusk server.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for status


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-v\fP, \fB--verbose\fP[=false]
	emit debug-level logs to stderr


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBtusk-claude(1)\fP
